note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note C4 extra-queue admission, scalar form for the freestanding engine. bridge-freest admits scalar
note parameters, literal shift counts and no loops, so the three queues are spelled out.
note i is the queue index; open has bit j set when queue j is already open (bits 1..3; other bits ignored).
note Same rule as op 6 of om/streams/streams.om: 0 index outside 1..3, 1 already open, 2 out of order, 3 open it.
fn streams_xq i ulong open ulong to ulong
if or eq i 0 gt i 3
ret 0
end
q1 = and shr open 1 1
q2 = and shr open 2 1
q3 = and shr open 3 1
if eq i 1
if ne q1 0
ret 1
end
ret 3
end
if eq i 2
if ne q2 0
ret 1
end
if eq q1 0
ret 2
end
ret 3
end
if ne q3 0
ret 1
end
if or eq q1 0 eq q2 0
ret 2
end
ret 3
end
